"Project-Id-Version: AI Transparency Declaration for OJS 0.2.0.3\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-07-24 00:00-0400\n"
"Last-Translator: AITD OJS adaptation\n"
"Language-Team: Portuguese\n"
